    "suptitle": "The persona-vectors synthetic suite's correlations are mostly the positive-vs-negative instruction contrast",
    "fig_texts": [
      "Each arm scored three ways on the SAME 200 suite contexts: pooled over both instruction polarities, then within each\n100-context half alone. Every arm's pooled value collapses when the polarity contrast is removed. Evil's negative half\nhas zero DV variance (all 100 contexts score 0), so within-half rho is undefined there."
